{"id":"n14793-1-8","stage":2,"title":"돌아다니다 · 转悠","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14793-1-8-1","ko":"오늘은 어디를 돌아다니다가 온 거야?","zh":"今天是在哪里逛来着？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘은","audio":"/audio/45021ad1ec5b4083b856.mp3"}},{"text":"어디를","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디를","audio":"/audio/30dd6318827dd406d486.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아다니다가","meaning":"转悠，跑来跑去","explanation":"돌아다니다：转悠，跑来跑去；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"돌아다니다","audio":"/audio/3dc06ed57f02bb9f3c9d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14793","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌아다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아다니다가","audio":"/audio/3eacc8f21265fec8ddb0.mp3"}},{"text":"온","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"온","audio":"/audio/dcc56310451956332238.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definiti